      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "If\n    $Z=[\\begin{aligned}-1\\end{aligned}],$ then ${Z}^{T}=$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the transpose, we interchange the rows and columns. \n\nHere, there is just a single row (or column), so it becomes a single column (or row):\n\n$$\n{Z}^{T}=Z=[\\begin{aligned}-1\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
